<title>USA: Ortonville ISD 62, Minn., won by Piper Jaffray.</title>
<headline>Ortonville ISD 62, Minn., won by Piper Jaffray.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray said it won $8.900 million of Ortonville ISD 62, Minn., general obligation school building bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.37 percent.</p>
</text>
